"<ulink url=\"http://sourceforge.net/projects/pptpclient/\">pptpclient</"
"ulink> - PPTP VPN"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:436
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<ulink url=\"http://www.openvpn.org/\">OpenVPN</ulink>.- VPN based on SSL"
msgstr ""
"<ulink url=\"http://www.openvpn.org/\">OpenVPN</ulink>.- VPN based on SSL"

#. Tag: para
